# Claude Code creates its worktrees inside the repository itself. The worktree
# directories, and the per-worktree .env that bin/worktree-sail rewrites, are
# generated local state and must never reach a commit. The tooling that
# generates them (bin/worktree-sail, compose.worktree.yaml, .worktreeinclude)
# is tracked, so every worktree inherits it straight from git.
/.claude/worktrees/
/.claude/settings.local.json
